      "description": "Stable native business tabs; preview omits device-specific system safe-area insets.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M7 3v4M17 3v4M3 11h18M8 16h3\"/></svg><span>今日</span></button><button aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h3\"/></svg><span>流水</span></button><button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h13a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2\"/><path d=\"M21 8h-7v8h7zM16 12h1\"/></svg><span>财富</span></button><button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 20V10m7 10V4m7 16v-7M3 4h3M17 7h4\"/></svg><span>规划</span></button></nav>",
